# Tests

- Angular specs use Arrange-Act-Assert and `TestBed`. Update the spec when public methods or template contracts change.
- Playwright projects are `silvervibe-e2e` and `vibestandup-e2e`. Run `npx nx e2e <project>`.
- Assert user-visible behavior (text, roles, navigation), not CSS class strings.
